WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.520
Okay, yinz, the Steelers game is almost on.

2
00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:05.880
Time to fire up Steel City Game Day.

3
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:07.000
Let’s check the Wire.

4
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:16.200
Feeling good about the black and gold this year.

5
00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:18.600
Okay, time to get the pregame picks in.

6
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:21.000
I wonder who’s going to get the crown today.

7
00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:24.200
Seems like Alex is always lucky
with this stuff, n’at.

8
00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:37.400
Okay, Flash Picks are up. Yinz going yes or no?

9
00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:40.300
I don’t know. That defense looks tough.

10
00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.200
Not sure the Stillers score before the half.

11
00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:47.880
Dang, it’s down to the wire.

12
00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:50.700
Who’s finishing on top in our crew?

13
00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:53.100
It better not be Alex.

14
00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:54.700
She always wins.

15
00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:02.300
Oh man, Alex took it.

16
00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:05.200
Alex took it. I knew it.

17
00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:11.460
Oh yes, took the crown for this game.

18
00:01:12.260 --> 00:01:15.500
Yinz better get used to it this season.

19
00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:17.280
Oh well, at least the Stillers won.

20
00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:18.540
Time for an Iron City.

21
00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:22.900
Here we go, Steelers! Here we go!
